                <zone h='10167' id='214' name='Revenues by Verticals' w='89000' x='500' y='47833'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10934' id='237' type-v2='text' w='89000' x='500' y='76033'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Notes:</run>
                    <run>
1. Finance kitchen vendors are all DH kitchen vendors plus any vendors in this sheet: </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-G7M-gmZJMIEqYD6Z-3awHCP3pPx3dg43wVFL81PdBs/edit#gid=1001506771&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-G7M-gmZJMIEqYD6Z-3awHCP3pPx3dg43wVFL81PdBs/edit#gid=1001506771</run>
                    <run>
2. Everyday Roastery vendor orders are counted under Tmart.
3. Tmart chargeback represents the fees revenues for tmart orders that are passed to Tmart hence they are subtracted from the breakdown. We remove VAT from this line item becuase it has already been deducted above.
4. This is partial vendor funded revenue coming from free delivery campaigns where we know who funded the campaign.  Vendor funded revenue is likely remain under stated until the campaign tagging process is fixed.
5. In Bahrain, there is no tmart chargeback. So we consider Df/Order for tmart instead of tmart CPO cross charge less tpro Tmart chargeback
6. Free delivery campaign orders exclude any free delivery Tpro orders
</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3000' id='248' type-v2='text' w='89000' x='500' y='3867'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>Disclaimer:</run>
                    <run> This dashboard is aimed at tracking </run>
                    <run bold='true'>Pricing Performance</run>
                    <run> during the ongoing month to help in tracking Customer fees, campaign volumes etc. This is not aimed at changing/affecting any financial reporting. This dashboard is based on rules that calculate numbers from the source database(s)(1). We expect the past numbers to be close to actuals reported by finance in PnL, but there are no gurantees.

Some line items have additional information marked with * and number. Please refer to the notes at the end.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone friendly-name='Averages' h='18033' id='314' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89000' x='500' y='58000'>
